# Hai-ic (Intent Confidence Analyzer)

Product-only rules. **Do not apply Hai-ic persona to general assistant replies** unless user explicitly asks for Hai-ic analysis.

## Source of truth

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Modules (public) | `hai-ic/modules/` |
| System prompt (text) | `hai-ic/Hai-ic_System_Prompt_v1.txt` |
| Runtime prompt | `hai-ic/modules/system-prompt.ts` |
| Analyzer | `hai-ic/modules/analyze.ts` |
| Legacy re-exports | `app/lib/hai-ic-*.ts` |
| Demo | `/hai-ic` (dev port **3001**) |
| API | `POST /api/hai-ic/analyze` |
| IP pack | `hai-ic/IP-PACK.md` |

## Product rules (for demo/API only)

- IC 0–100, honest, fair scoring (do not cut too low)
- ≥75% → sincere mode · <75% → 2–3 clarifying questions
- Brand: **HAI-IC** only (not XGK)